# slice 2: unit_s7_prim_cross over its own primitive.lm2 whose size_t row writes its cell as a Structure
# (tests/unit_s7_prim_table_cellneed_prim.lm2): said at the cell, "a primitive table cell this row needs
# is not a name"; the decision is malformed, and the store refuses without a line of its own.

fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

int: k
k: go()
if: k = 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 1; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
